/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Root8[4]+ <-> Sixth[14]+ (record
r8f:R822+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR822pTHX` and `wR8fR822pTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 8`
and `2 ^ 17`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

